time-payload-all-3530.validator-result.v1.json` is intentionally `validator_status=blocked`, not `pass`.\n\nThe passing coverage gates are:\n\n- `total_payload_row_count = 3530`\n- `missing_payload_row_count = 0`\n- `valid_payload_row_count = 3530`\n- `invalid_payload_row_count = 0`\n- `missing_accepted_semantic_context_payload_row_count = 3518`\n\nThe single blocked gate is `semantic_unavailable_status_present_or_blocked`: current checked-in semantic layers produce `semantic_context.status=unavailable` count `0`. I did not invent unavailable rows. The readback records the current taxonomy explicitly: source `evidence_availability_status=unavailable` rows are `3530`, and source `method_diagnostic_posture=routing_logging_review_queue_only` rows are `3530`, while payload semantic states are `accepted_available=12`, `provisional_only=2101`, `blocked=1417`.\n\n## Artifact inventory\n\n- Read model: `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/question-runtime-payload-all-3530-read-model.v1.json`\n- Manifest: `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/question-runtime-payload-all-3530.manifest.v1.json`\n- Validator: `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/question-runtime-payload-all-3530.validator-result.v1.json`\n- Readback: `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/question-runtime-payload-all-3530.readback.md`\n\n## Mutation boundary\n\n- Checked-in artifacts only: `true`\n- Remote Supabase query required: `false`\n- Remote Supabase mutation performed: `false`\n- Remote disposable Supabase write performed: `false`\n- Production RAG reindex performed: `false`\n- Vector store mutation performed: `false`\n- Runtime API integration performed: `false`\n- Frontend UI integration performed: `false`\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/question-runtime-payload-schema.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/question-runtime-payload-artifact-adapter.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/question-runtime-payload-all-3530.test.js`\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-question-runtime-payload-schema.mjs scripts/method-map/build-question-runtime-payload-artifact-adapter.mjs scripts/method-map/build-question-runtime-payload-all-3530.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/question-runtime-payload-schema.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/question-runtime-payload-artifact-adapter.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/question-runtime-payload-all-3530.test.js`\n- `git diff --cached --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n\nParent: #1404\nDepends on: #1407\nCloses #1408","created_at":"2026-07-07T04:03:30Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T04:14:34Z","closed_at":"2026-07-07T04:14:34Z","merged_at":"2026-07-07T04:14:33Z","merge_commit_sha":"664bb4b19f7b3428be6f60a8dc09a2b493a73234","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1419/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1419/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1419/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/899fd6db77900e3fa464d28aaf3ffa06ea465999","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1408","ref":"feat/issue-1408","sha":"899fd6db77900e3fa464d28aaf3ffa06ea465999","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}